{"title":"Moonwing Dust","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Luna Moth</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>Every gem transmuter has a <b>Reagent</b> tab, the Dark Witch included. This reagent and <b>500 gold</b> get you a <a href=\"#/item/gem-amber\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\">Amber</a> of <b>1c, 1.5c or 2c</b>. Monsters no longer drop reagents.</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a>.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"luna-moth\" title=\"Luna Moth - dropped it in 2 of 292 looted corpses (1/146)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a3b4c44c77eff00cb465.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/146<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"moonwing-dust\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/a9b755d383d646fc37f6.svg\" alt=\"Moonwing Dust\"></div><h3>Moonwing Dust</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>1 monster</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>11/1/2026, 2:55:42 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}